- separation of powers (*Nixon v. Fitzgerald*);
- officials' willingness to act in legally unsettled areas (*Mitchell*);
- state sovereign dignity (*Puerto Rico Aqueduct*);
- protection against repeated prosecutions by the government (*Abney*).

